 "text": "GIS Maps - Fall River County, South Dakota\nSkip to content\nOctober 18, 2026\nFall River County, South Dakota\n906 N. River Street, Hot Springs, SD 57747\nHome\nOnline Map\nDirectory »\nAuditors & Welfare Office\nPublic Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H/Extension Service\nGIS Maps\nHighway Department\nPlanning & Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Services\nWeed & Pest\nCommission »\nMeeting\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Ordinances\n2026 Minute Archive\n2025 Minute Archive\n2024 Minute Archive\nOlder Minute Archives\nLaw & Court »\nClerk of Court\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nPress Release Archive\nEmployment (2)\nContact\nOglala Lakota Co.\nGIS Maps\nServices:\n9-1-1 Address Assignment\nMap purchase\nCurrent Road Names\nReference Tables for Online Map:\nLand & Building Classes\nOnline Maps:\nGIS Maps – main county online map: property ownership and address searches; school, fire, ambulance districts; disaster layers: wildfires, flood zones, earthquakes\nFall River County’s Story – Map of historic events for Fall River County\nPaper Maps:\nAdministrative Districts: Fire Districts , Ambulance/School District\n*School Districts are the same as ambulance districts\nAg Assessment : Soil Rating\nLandowners: by township & range\nCity Block & Lot Map: Ardmore , Edgemont , Oral , Oelrichs , Provo , Hot Springs, Hot Springs Additions , Smithwick\nCounty Roads: County Roads\nEmergency: Flood Zones\nSubdivisions : Fall River County Subdivisions\nBlack Hills Flyway & Silverspur\nEast Angostura – part 1 & part 2\nGreen Valley & Whitetail Rd\nPaha Sapa & Snows Ponderosa\nPine Shadows & Himmelwright\nSheps Canyon Estates\nRed Rock Ridge Subd\nSmithwick, Town\nSand Creek Reserve Subd\nWest Angostura\nVoting Precincts: Fall River County Precincts , Edgemont Voting Precincts , Hot Springs Voting Precincts\nGIS is the acronym for Geographical Information Systems. The GIS office provides maps and related information to county offices, emergency services, and government agencies. This office also handles the assigning of 9-1-1 addresses in the county.\nGIS Coordinator:\nStacey Martin\n1029 N. River St.\nHot Springs, SD 57747\n(605) 745-7584\ngis@fallrivercountysd.gov\nTreasurer\nReal Estate Tax Payment Information\nMill Levy Sheet 2024 pay 2025\nMilly Levy by Entity\nProperty Tax Lookup\nSouth Dakota Grassland Fire Danger Index\nNational Grassland Fire Ban\nNational Forest Fire Ban\nNational Active Fires Map\nSouth Annex Building Schedule\nFall River County Contact List\nContact List\nNational Association of Counties\nhttp://www.naco.org/\nWebsite Survey\nWe would love to hear from you! Please fill out this form and we will get in touch with you shortly.\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nWhere did you hear about our website? *\nSearch Engine\nNewspaper\nFriend\nOther\nWhat information were you looking for on this website? *\nGeneral Information\nSpecific Information\nJust Curious\nOther\nDid you find the information you were looking for? *\nYes\nNo\nMaybe\nWhat information were you looking for? (Please be specific so that we can improve our website.)\nPlease include your email below if you wish to be contacted regarding your question or request for information. Only those who provided a request for information above will will receive a response.\nSubmit\nEmployee Portal\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in\nNotifications",
